# Business Operating System

A modular business operating system designed to coordinate business workflows, AI employees, automation, and industry-specific capabilities.

## Architecture

The repository is organized around product applications, reusable packages, business modules, AI agents, and engineering documentation.

- `apps/` — deployable product applications and services
- `packages/` — reusable platform libraries
- `modules/` — business-domain capabilities
- `agents/` — AI employee and automation capabilities
- `docs/` — architecture, engineering, security, and operational documentation

## Engineering principles

- Security first
- Verification required
- Small, testable changes
- Architecture before features
- Documentation accompanies features
- Human authority for high-risk autonomous actions

OAE (Open Autonomous Engineer) is maintained as a separate engineering system and may operate this repository through governed repository workflows.
